WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.460
- So the reports are the Joel Greenberg,

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.983
friend of Matt Gaetz in
the Gaetz-Gate scandal,

00:00:03.983 --> 00:00:06.600
has reached an agreement with authorities

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.750
and has entered into some
sort of plea agreement.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.230
Greenberg's lawyer, Fritz Scheller,

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.540
said on the courthouse steps:

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.040
- I'm sure Matt Gaetz is not feeling

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.960
very comfortable today, alright?

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.680
- Now it's not clear if
this is a plea agreement

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.260
where you just simply agree to cooperate

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.560
in exchange for a light
reduction in sentence

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.280
to make things easier on the prosecutor

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.130
or if this is a cooperation agreement

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.451
where you agree to cooperate against

00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:26.938
a bigger fish in this case

00:00:26.938 --> 00:00:29.374
that could probably only mean Matt Gaetz.

00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:33.640
So we'll see if Matt Gaetz
really is feeling uncomfortable

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.953
and we'll see if we see him in court.

